#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.2.8.rst:2
msgid "Version 4.2.8"
msgstr "버전 4.2.8"

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.2.8.rst:4
msgid "Release Date: October 30, 2022"
msgstr "릴리즈 날짜: 2022년 10월 30일"

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.2.8.rst:6
msgid "**4.2.8 release of CodeIgniter4**"
msgstr "**CodeIgniter4\ 의 4.2.8 릴리즈**"

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.2.8.rst:13
msgid "Deprecations"
msgstr "사용 중단"

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.2.8.rst:15
msgid ""
"The third parameter ``$returnResponse`` of "
"``CodeIgniter::handleRequest()`` is deprecated."
msgstr "``CodeIgniter::handleRequest()``\ 의 세 번째 파라미터 ``$returnResponse``\ 가 사용 중단되었습니다."

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.2.8.rst:18
msgid "Bugs Fixed"
msgstr "버그 수정"

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.2.8.rst:20
msgid ""
"Fixed a bug when the ``CodeIgniter\\HTTP\\IncomingRequest::getPostGet()``"
" and ``CodeIgniter\\HTTP\\IncomingRequest::getGetPost()`` methods didn't "
"return values from the other stream when ``index`` was set to ``null``."
msgstr ""
"``index``\ 가 ``null``\ 로 설정되었을 때 ``CodeIgniter\\HTTP\\IncomingRequest::getPostGet()``\ 과 "
"``CodeIgniter\\HTTP\\IncomingRequest::getGetPost()`` 메서드가 다른 스트림의 값을 반환하지 않던 버그가 수정되었습니다."

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.2.8.rst:21
msgid ""
"Fixed a bug when ``binds`` weren't cleaned properly when calling "
"``CodeIgniter\\Database\\Postgre::replace()`` multiple times in the "
"context."
msgstr "컨텍스트에서 ``CodeIgniter\\Database\\Postgre::replace()``\ 를 여러 번 호출할 때 ``binds``\ 가 올바르게 정리되지 않던 버그가 수정되었습니다."

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.2.8.rst:22
msgid ""
"Fixed a bug when the "
"``CodeIgniter\\Database\\SQLSRV\\PreparedQuery::_getResult()`` was "
"returning the bool value instead of the resource."
msgstr "``CodeIgniter\\Database\\SQLSRV\\PreparedQuery::_getResult()``\ 가 리소스 대신 bool 값을 반환하던 버그가 수정되었습니다."

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.2.8.rst:23
msgid ""
"Fixed a bug in the error handler where in cases the callback cannot "
"process the error level it does not pass the error to PHP's standard "
"error handler."
msgstr "콜백이 오류 수준을 처리할 수 없는 경우 PHP의 표준 오류 핸들러에 오류를 전달하지 않던 오류 핸들러의 버그가 수정되었습니다."

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.2.8.rst:25
msgid ""
"See the repo's `CHANGELOG_4.2.md "
"<https://github.com/codeigniter4/CodeIgniter4/blob/develop/changelogs/CHANGELOG_4.2.md>`_"
" for a complete list of bugs fixed."
msgstr ""
"수정된 버그의 전체 목록은 저장소의 `CHANGELOG_4.2.md "
"<https://github.com/codeigniter4/CodeIgniter4/blob/develop/changelogs/CHANGELOG_4.2.md>`_\ 을 참조하십시오."
